    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a pretty intense list. It sounds like you're saying it was mostly just intentional policy decisions by politicians. Don't you think there are any other non-political factors, like tech or how the global economy has changed, or is it really just down to those specific political shifts you mentioned?",
