      "content": "That seems like a pretty one-sided way to look at it. You're basically saying that all the big changes in the world over the last few decades were just excuses for politicians to help corporations. Isn't it possible that things like automation or the shift toward a service economy were just inevitable global trends that no single government could really control?",
